{"4144560": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Biggest Deck in Jail", "steam_appid": 4144560, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Congratulations, inmate. You’ve been sentenced to the <strong>most dangerous prison on Earth</strong>.<br>You’re stuck in prison with a big deck, the biggest deck. Your goal? <strong>Escape jail.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4144560/extras/c98edad90f7d3ad891f390fc038b05a8.avif?t=1772231591\" width=600 height=120 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>💀 PERMA-DEATH 💀</strong><br>One wrong move and you’re pancakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>・REAL WEAPONS &amp; SOUNDS</strong> <br>Real Guns, Bats, Cutters and sounds, everything you’d expect in a wholesome facility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>・CHOOSE YOUR GANG</strong><br>Gorillas, Wolves or Rats?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>・COMMUNICATION</strong><br>Negotiate, toilet-trade, bribe, or just solve disagreements with high-speed lead. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>・LOOT LIKE FREEDOM IS ON SALE</strong><br>Loot cells, boxes and people you drop, also different colors of soap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>・UPGRADE YOUR BRAIN</strong><br>Use the brain skilltree to unlock new perks to support your big deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>・EQUIP YOUR DECK</strong><br>Mix and match weapons, armor, and cards to build your biggest deck of destruction. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this jail, deck size matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Congratulations, inmate. You’ve been sentenced to the <strong>most dangerous prison on Earth</strong>.<br>You’re stuck in prison with a big deck, the biggest deck. Your goal? <strong>Escape jail.</